    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A profound, biting chill settles into the bones of the one who wields this polearm. Its blade holds a frost that never thaws, turning every strike into a winter's death. This is a relic of the deepest cold, capable of halting the very motion of life."
